      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The Jester performs as somebody the audience wants to see. Each creature within 30 feet that can see and hear him makes a DC 13 Wisdom (Insight) check; on a failure it treats him as that person for one minute, or until he does something the real person would not. Bowser has already fallen for this once tonight and has advantage on the check.</p>",
